b671-ed8827d6cdfb" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396619 1074 "A block lower triangular matrix can be partitioned so that it has only square blocks on the main diagonal, and the blocks above the main diagonal contain only zeros.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our matrices.\n\n- $A$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- $B$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- $C$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$A,$ $B,$ and $C.$\"" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396621 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396622 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396623 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396624 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396625 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396625 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396620 1080 #uuid "b4cfca3f-c3d8-5194-b838-5df8371ad384" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396621 1081 "$A$ and $C$ only" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396621 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396621 1084 #uuid "c4860770-5064-5335-8f48-a983fc3e37dc" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396622 1081 "None" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17