.$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{6}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x={lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[{e}^{6i/n}\\cdot \\frac{6}{n}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=6.$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396628 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396629 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396630 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396631 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396632 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1077 "selection" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396629 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396627 1080 #uuid "224da74b-2945-552e-a5c2-10b9f76d854e" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396628 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{6x}$ and $b=6$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396628 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396628 1084 #uuid "34cc89b8-44ed-5197-913c-4b08fc997159" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396629 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{x}$ and $b=6$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396629 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396629 1084 #uuid "e2308dd8-f04b-55a3-a357-4d4562b92a56" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396630 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{6x}$ and $b=1$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396630 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396630 1084 #uuid "d9ab5d51-4c5d-5e5c-bd82-b3125ac54774" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396631 1081 "$f(x)={e}^{2x}$ and $b=3$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396631 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396631 1084 #uuid "68909286-13b5-56f8-91c1-b39ee0