\\ {u}^{′} & ={e}^{-x}(2x-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides with respect to $x$ (omitting the arbitrary constant), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′} & ={e}^{-x}(2x-5) \\\\ \\int {u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{-x}(2x-5)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ u & =\\int {e}^{-x}(2x-5)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${y}_{p}=u(x){e}^{x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p} & =u(x){e}^{x} \\\\  & =\\int {e}^{-x}(2x-5)\\,\\text{d}x\\cdot {e}^{x} \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\int {e}^{-x}(2x-5)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396958 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396959 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396960 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396961 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1077 "field-3" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396958 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396957 1080 #uuid "008636f6-a3d9-555d-ad4c-a5efd04935ce" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396958 1081 "{e}^{x}\\int {e}^{-x}(2x-5)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396958 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396958 1084 #uuid "c107f37e-7439-51cd-8125-7b533838b1a2" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396959 1081 "{e}^{x}\\int {e}^{-x}(2x+5)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396959 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396959 1084 #uuid "7d799668-ca03-5716-985f-696822b47c93" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396960 1081 "{e}^{-x}\\int {e}^{-x}(5-2x)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396960 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186396960 1084 #