),1⟩+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx),1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the functions\n$1,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x),…$\nare orthogonal with respect to the defined inner product, the only nonzero term in the final expression above is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}⟨1,1⟩.\n$$\n\nComputing the inner product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨1,1⟩ & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[x]}_{-0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =2\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨f(x),1⟩ & =\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}⟨1,1⟩ \\\\ {a}_{0} & =\\frac{2⟨f(x),1⟩}{⟨1,1⟩} \\\\ {a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }(3x+1)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397472 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397473 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397474 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397475 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397476 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1077 "field-3" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397476 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397471 1080 #uuid "40e8826c-c720-5c71-8e60-9efc9028ee9f" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397472 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }(3x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397472 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397472 1084 #uuid "0d7d31a3-b2e8-5955-b7a5-8d0265e34185" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397473 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }(3x+1)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 t