terval $(-2,2),$ the linear approximation $L(x)$ is above the graph near $x=0,$ and therefore we have an $\\text{overestimate}.$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397663 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397664 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397665 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397666 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397667 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1077 "field-1" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397665 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397662 1080 #uuid "8a9687f0-3dbc-5f03-bc8c-36c768da7028" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397663 1081 "1.6" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397663 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397663 1084 #uuid "4d40eb58-2655-5469-940e-f80c613a366a" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397664 1081 "2.4" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397664 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397664 1084 #uuid "cd504e90-e5b7-56c6-964b-40f89c7b3493" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397665 1081 "2.2" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397665 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397665 1084 #uuid "a07cbcd9-56d0-586c-aa21-1a80b6af5ef6" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397666 1081 "1.8" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397666 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397666 1084 #uuid "9fc20b50-1f58-592c-8612-6b49865b0664" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397667 1081 "2.0" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397667 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 131941