}\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides with respect to $x$ (omitting the arbitrary constant), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′} & ={e}^{3x}(1-4x) \\\\ \\int {u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {e}^{3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ u & =\\int {e}^{3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${y}_{p}=u(x){e}^{-3x},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p} & =u(x){e}^{-3x} \\\\  & =\\int {e}^{3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x\\cdot {e}^{-3x} \\\\  & ={e}^{-3x}\\int {e}^{3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397692 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397693 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397694 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397695 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1077 "field-3" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397695 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397691 1080 #uuid "5a467a6f-a5c6-5790-ac4d-f97c7812ce6a" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397692 1081 "{e}^{3x}\\int {e}^{-3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397692 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397692 1084 #uuid "36dc406b-5149-5aeb-99f4-c422c56adc09" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397693 1081 "{e}^{3x}\\int {e}^{3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397693 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397693 1084 #uuid "11154d93-5ccc-5c68-a857-aee315edeb48" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397694 1081 "{e}^{-3x}\\int {e}^{-3x}(1-4x)\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397694 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533469 17592186045585 true] [17592186397694 1084 #uuid "23e73190-9abd-5014-877